{"id":"6411987be5be125a","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-nakayama.md","title":"Nakayama's Lemma","display":"thm-nakayama — Nakayama's Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-nakayama","aliases":["58-thm-nakayama"],"display":"thm-nakayama — Nakayama's Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-nakayama"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-nakayama</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nakayama — Nakayama's Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e6a1ed8511f909f2\" href=\"?note=e6a1ed8511f909f2\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md\">../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,M,I,N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\odot\\in V\">\\(R,M,I,N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\odot\\in V\\)</span> (ring/module data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Module}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Module}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Jac}\">\\(\\mathrm{Jac}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e6a1ed8511f909f2\" href=\"?note=e6a1ed8511f909f2\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md\">../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModuleFinitelyGenerated}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ModuleFinitelyGenerated}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdealModuleProduct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IdealModuleProduct}_S\\)</span> (the set of finite sums of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>-multiples, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}generated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleFinitelyGenerated}_S(M,R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists G\\subseteq M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Finite}(G)\\land\n\\forall m\\in M\\;\\exists c\\in R^G\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{supp}(c))\\land\nm=\\sum_{g\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}c(g)\\odot g\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}module\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}generated}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModuleFinitelyGenerated}_S(M,R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists G\\subseteq M\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Finite}(G)\\land\n\\forall m\\in M\\;\\exists c\\in R^G\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{supp}(c))\\land\nm=\\sum_{g\\in\\operatorname{supp}(c)}c(g)\\odot g\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}module\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IdealModuleProduct}_S(N,I,M,R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\nN=\\left\\{x\\in M:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists a\\in I^n\\;\\exists u\\in M^n\\;\nx=\\sum_{j&lt;n}a(j)\\odot u(j)\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}module\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IdealModuleProduct}_S(N,I,M,R,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\nN=\\left\\{x\\in M:\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists a\\in I^n\\;\\exists u\\in M^n\\;\nx=\\sum_{j&lt;n}a(j)\\odot u(j)\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nakayama}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ModuleFinitelyGenerated}_S(M,R,\\odot)\n\\land\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Jac}(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{IdealModuleProduct}_S(M,I,M,R,\\odot)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\to M=\\{0_M\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nakayama}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Module}_S(M,R,+_M,0_M,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ModuleFinitelyGenerated}_S(M,R,\\odot)\n\\land\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S(I;R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Jac}(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{IdealModuleProduct}_S(M,I,M,R,\\odot)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\to M=\\{0_M\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>行列式技巧先给出某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in I\">\\(a\\in I\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1-a)M=0\">\\((1-a)M=0\\)</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Jac}(R)\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathrm{Jac}(R)\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-a\">\\(1-a\\)</span> 是单位，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=0\">\\(M=0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdealModuleProduct}_S(M,I,M,R,\\odot)\">\\(\\mathrm{IdealModuleProduct}_S(M,I,M,R,\\odot)\\)</span> 是原来非形式记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"IM=M\">\\(IM=M\\)</span> 的展开；其右端只含有限个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>-系数的模元素线性组合。</li>\n<li>对局部环 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R,\\mathfrak m)\">\\((R,\\mathfrak m)\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\mathfrak m\">\\(I=\\mathfrak m\\)</span> 得到常用推论：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M/\\mathfrak mM=0\">\\(M/\\mathfrak mM=0\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=0\">\\(M=0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md","status":"resolved","id":"e6a1ed8511f909f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Module}_S$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-module.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md","status":"resolved","id":"e6a1ed8511f909f2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S$ and $\\mathrm{Jac}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-jacobson-radical.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,M,I,N,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Module}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LeftIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Jac}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}",